    "description": "<p>This polearm ends in three sharp tines. Variations range from the military fork with just two tines, to the nine-dragon trident, which has a forest of spikes, flanges and crossbars. In addition to poking at an enemy like a spear, the trident's tines make it especially good for catching an opponent's weapon to disarm him. A trident also deals extra damage if used in a charge, or set against a charging opponent.</p>",
